+ ## 3. Dates and the prior-interview claim remain separate
+ 
+-**PG1602p10** is a communication dated **09/22/2001**, Pittsburgh to Pittsburgh. The information-received field says **09/20/2001,11:18PM**, source label **SOMERSET CRASH DP** (unexpanded). Its continuation on **p11** reports contact and a reply that the person had been interviewed by FBI New York. Some wording near the end of the first line is obscured by markings; the legible phrase **“INTERVIEWED BY FBI NEW YORK”** is retained without inventing missing text. The form's **Event Date09/11/2001; Time12:00PM** is an administrative field whose relation to the reported call is unverified.
